SUMMARY:HXD Week: 1929 Allen Parkway Headquarters Tour
DESCRIPTION:The Confidential Headquarters Project is a new ground-up\, Class A Office Building located at 1929 Allen Parkway. The project has 9 occupiable floors and a 5-level podium parking garage. The interiors scope features amenities such as a full-service commercial kitchen & coffee bar\, conferencing center\, terrace\, and fitness center with upscale locker rooms. The 8 workplace floors are dedicated to workstations\, private offices\, and business support\, and an executive suite with a monumental stair. HOK is the building designer with PDR designing interior amenities and workplace. Project completion will be August 2026. \nPhotography is strictly prohibited. \nLight bites and beverages (non-alcoholic) will be provided. \nParking: Validated onsite garage parking available. Tour will begin on Level 06
URL:https://architecturehouston.org/event/confidentialtour/
LOCATION:Private: 1929 Allen Parkway\, 1929 Allen Parkway\, Houston\, TX\, 77019\, United States
CATEGORIES:Interior Architecture Committee
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://architecturehouston.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/REFRESHMENTS-Large.webp
ORGANIZER;CN="Alex Moreno":MAILTO:alexm@aiahouston.org
END:VEVENT
